Probe the test actor host's peer server from an explicit loopback socket.

quic.DialAddr binds a wildcard [::] UDP socket, and sending from it to an IPv4
loopback address is denied by the Darwin build sandbox even with
__darwinAllowLocalNetworking, so the readiness probe added in
https://github.com/pocket-id/pocket-id/pull/1526 never succeeds and every test
using NewActorHostForTest fails after a 10 second timeout.

